# The preset ("plate": P1 140, P2 160, fully wet) on FX2 with a click train, like drums sent to it: a dense, smooth
# tail of ~4 s that rings on past the last hit.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 4
track fx2
input impulse 2 0.7
preset 140 160 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
gain 1
expect sound 0 16
expect peak_below -6
